# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER commit the game's assets or anything made from them (docs/GETTING-ASSETS.md, "Legal").
# The art cache lives outside the repository (~/.crforge/art); these patterns catch copies, test
# outputs and recordings that land inside it by mistake.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
